  "animals": {
    "title": "Animals and meat",
    "summary": "The animals keep their native names on their own — いぬ, うし, さかな, とり — and switch to on readings in compounds: 牛肉 ぎゅうにく, 人魚 にんぎょ, 白鳥 はくちょう. 肉 has no native reading at all: にく is on.",
